# Allow-list: only deliverables are committed. Everything at the project root is ignored unless listed below,
# so internal working files can never be pushed by accident. Add a line here (with a "!") to publish a new file.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/docs/
!/.github/
!/backend/
!/web/

# Inside backend/ and web/, their own .gitignore files keep out .venv, node_modules, dist, .env, caches.
